{"alias":"/learning/standards/mathematics","title":"Mathematics Standards","changed":"2026-08-04T13:35:35+00:00","before":"<h3><img alt=\"Math Standards Web Banner\" data-entity-type=\"file\" data-entity-uuid=\"af5c1987-2137-4ffd-9a85-30696ffa0b63\" height=\"100%\" src=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-images/Standards%20%26%20Instruction%20-%20Math%20Standards%20-%20Web%20Banner.png\" width=\"100%\" /></h3>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"text-align-left\">The Maine Learning Results, which incorporates the Common Core State Standards, is a single set of clear educational standards for mathematics. These standards are designed to ensure that students graduating from high school are prepared to go to college or enter the workforce, and parents, teachers and students have a clear understanding of what is expected of them.</p>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\r\n<div class=\"col-sm-6\">\r\n<div class=\"card\"><img alt=\"k-12 document card\" class=\"card-img-top\" height=\"100%\" src=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-images/Standards%20%26%20Instruction%20-%20Math%20Standards%20-%20K12%20Documents%20Card.png\" width=\"100%\" />\r\n<div class=\"card-body\">\r\n<h5 class=\"card-title\">Standards Documents</h5>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"card-text\">A strong mathematics education depends upon a clear understanding of its interrelated concepts, skills, and practices to ensure students are on the pathway to success in their academic careers. The knowledge and skills students need to be prepared for mathematics in college, career, and life are woven throughout the K-12 mathematics performance expectations.</p>\r\n\r\n<ul class=\"list-group list-group-flush\">\r\n\t<li class=\"list-group-item\"><a class=\"file file--mime-application-pdf file--application-pdf\" data-entity-type=\"file\" data-entity-uuid=\"424f8d7b-0f55-4600-866e-09a61b1cff87\" filename=\"Standards &amp; Instruction - Math Standards Overview - 2.18.2020.pdf\" href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Standards%20%26%20Instruction%20-%20Math%20Standards%20Overview%20-%202.18.2020.pdf\">Full Overview</a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Standards by Strand</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul class=\"list-group list-group-flush\">\r\n\t<li class=\"list-group-item\"><a class=\"file file--mime-application-pdf file--application-pdf\" data-entity-type=\"file\" data-entity-uuid=\"4cfa8968-cd9f-4db6-aef3-37a6d4bccfbc\" filename=\"Standards &amp; Instruction - Math Standards Quantative Reasoning - 2.18.2020.pdf\" href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Standards%20%26%20Instruction%20-%20Math%20Standards%20Quantative%20Reasoning%20-%202.18.2020.pdf\">Quantitative Reasoning</a></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"list-group-item\"><a class=\"file file--mime-application-pdf file--application-pdf\" data-entity-type=\"file\" data-entity-uuid=\"4ade2e16-21ab-4a2a-94c9-5dd61d44ffb7\" filename=\"Standards &amp; Instruction - Math Standards Algebraic Reasoning - 2.18.2020.pdf\" href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Standards%20%26%20Instruction%20-%20Math%20Standards%20Algebraic%20Reasoning%20-%202.18.2020.pdf\">Algebraic Reasoning</a></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"list-group-item\"><a class=\"file file--mime-application-pdf file--application-pdf\" data-entity-type=\"file\" data-entity-uuid=\"103051a2-c1e1-4f18-959a-90a318af2421\" filename=\"Standards &amp; Instruction - Math Standards Geometric Reasoning - 2.18.2020.pdf\" href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Standards%20%26%20Instruction%20-%20Math%20Standards%20Geometric%20Reasoning%20-%202.18.2020.pdf\">Geometric Reasoning</a></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"list-group-item\"><a class=\"file file--mime-application-pdf file--application-pdf\" data-entity-type=\"file\" data-entity-uuid=\"068063c0-ab6c-4a0e-9b7d-7eb63ab3eaac\" filename=\"Standards &amp; Instruction - Math Standards Statistical Reasoning - 2.18.2020.pdf\" href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Standards%20%26%20Instruction%20-%20Math%20Standards%20Statistical%20Reasoning%20-%202.18.2020.pdf\">Statistical Reasoning</a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Standards by Grade Span</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul class=\"list-group list-group-flush\">\r\n\t<li class=\"list-group-item\"><a class=\"file file--mime-application-pdf file--application-pdf\" data-entity-type=\"file\" data-entity-uuid=\"4f8a4a32-8d80-4900-9839-1649f98938a7\" filename=\"Standards &amp; Instruction - Childhood Math Standards - 2.18.2020.pdf\" href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Standards%20%26%20Instruction%20-%20Childhood%20Math%20Standards%20-%202.18.2020.pdf\">Childhood (K-5)</a></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"list-group-item\"><a class=\"file file--mime-application-pdf file--application-pdf\" data-entity-type=\"file\" data-entity-uuid=\"7a302172-74be-4f2f-84c3-831b5ebbf073\" filename=\"Standards &amp; Instruction - Early Adolescence Standards - 2.18.2020.pdf\" href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Standards%20%26%20Instruction%20-%20Early%20Adolescence%20Standards%20-%202.18.2020.pdf\">Early Adolescence (6-8)</a></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"list-group-item\"><a class=\"file file--mime-application-pdf file--application-pdf\" data-entity-type=\"file\" data-entity-uuid=\"363b05fc-abcf-4409-9458-138cbf916c3d\" filename=\"Standards &amp; Instruction - Adolescence Math Standards - 2.18.2020.pdf\" href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Standards%20%26%20Instruction%20-%20Adolescence%20Math%20Standards%20-%202.18.2020.pdf\">Adolescence (9-Diploma)</a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"col-sm-6\">\r\n<div class=\"card\"><img alt=\"additional resrouces card\" class=\"card-img-top\" src=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-images/Standards%20%26%20Instruction%20-%20Math%20Standards%20-%20Additional%20Resources%20Card.png\" width=\"100%\" />\r\n<div class=\"card-body\">\r\n<h5 class=\"card-title\">Resources &amp; Support</h5>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Support Documents</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul class=\"list-group list-group-flush\">\r\n\t<li class=\"list-group-item\"><a class=\"file file--mime-application-pdf file--application-pdf\" data-entity-type=\"file\" data-entity-uuid=\"08c6d3b5-1290-4228-b37e-1fa2780dce5a\" filename=\"Standards &amp; Instruction - Math Standards Common Addition &amp; Subtraction Situations - 2.18.2020.pdf\" href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Standards%20%26%20Instruction%20-%20Math%20Standards%20Common%20Addition%20%26%20Subtraction%20Situations%20-%202.18.2020.pdf\">Common Addition &amp; Subtraction Situations</a></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"list-group-item\"><a class=\"file file--mime-application-pdf file--application-pdf\" data-entity-type=\"file\" data-entity-uuid=\"fd02ce84-b590-41fc-ad31-6a712983e5cd\" filename=\"Standards &amp; Instruction - Math Standards Common Multiplication &amp; Division Situations - 2.18.2020.pdf\" href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Standards%20%26%20Instruction%20-%20Math%20Standards%20Common%20Multiplication%20%26%20Division%20Situations%20-%202.18.2020.pdf\">Common Multiplication &amp; Division Situations</a></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"list-group-item\"><a class=\"file file--mime-application-pdf file--application-pdf\" data-entity-type=\"file\" data-entity-uuid=\"eb6e56ab-91aa-4af3-8624-ad4e6442339c\" filename=\"Standards &amp; Instruction - Math Standards Properties of Operations Equality &amp; Inequality - 2.18.2020.pdf\" href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Standards%20%26%20Instruction%20-%20Math%20Standards%20Properties%20of%20Operations%20Equality%20%26%20Inequality%20-%202.18.2020.pdf\">The Properties of Operations, Equality, &amp; Inequality</a></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"list-group-item\"><a class=\"file file--mime-application-pdf file--application-pdf\" data-entity-type=\"file\" data-entity-uuid=\"ca9480b8-1675-4fc3-92f5-a357708523ae\" filename=\"Standards &amp; Instruction - Math Standards Common Core Glossary - 2.18.2020.pdf\" href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Standards%20%26%20Instruction%20-%20Math%20Standards%20Common%20Core%20Glossary%20-%202.18.2020.pdf\">Glossary</a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Support Videos</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul class=\"list-group list-group-flush\">\r\n\t<li class=\"list-group-item\"><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=9FbWyXEjcNA\">Introduction to the Revised Standards Documents</a></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"list-group-item\"><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=hGo4TKa-004\">Overview of the 8 Effective Teaching Practices</a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<b>Additional Resources</b></p>\r\n\r\n<ul class=\"list-group list-group-flush\">\r\n\t<li class=\"list-group-item\"><a href=\"https://achievethecore.org/\">Achieve the Core</a><br />\r\n\t- <a href=\"http://achievethecore.org/coherence-map/\">Coherence Map</a><br />\r\n\t- <a href=\"https://achievethecore.org/category/774/mathematics-focus-by-grade-level\">Focus by Grade Level</a><br />\r\n\t- <a href=\"https://achievethecore.org/page/254/progressions-documents-for-the-common-core-state-standards-for-mathematics\">Progression Documents</a></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"list-group-item\"><a href=\"https://www.illustrativemathematics.org/\">Illustrative Mathematics</a><br />\r\n\t- <a href=\"https://tasks.illustrativemathematics.org/content-standards\">Content Standards</a><br />\r\n\t- <a href=\"http://tasks.illustrativemathematics.org/practice-standards/\">Practice Standards</a></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"list-group-item\"><a href=\"https://www.nctm.org/\">National Council of Teachers of Mathematics (NCTM)</a><br />\r\n\t- <a href=\"https://www.nctm.org/mathematics2021/\">Continuing the Journey: Mathematics Learning 2021 and Beyond</a></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"list-group-item\"><a href=\"https://www.mathedleadership.org/\">National Council of Supervisors of Mathematics (NCSM)</a></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"list-group-item\"><a href=\"https://assm.wildapricot.org/\">Association of State Supervisors of Mathematics (ASSM)</a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n</div>\r\n","after":"<div class=\"doe-hero\">\n<p class=\"doe-lead\">The Maine Learning Results, which incorporates the Common Core State Standards, is a single set of clear educational standards for mathematics. These standards are designed to ensure that students graduating from high school are prepared to go to college or enter the workforce, and parents, teachers and students have a clear understanding of what is expected of them.</p>\n\n</div>\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\r\n<div class=\"col-sm-6\">\r\n<div class=\"card\"><img alt=\"k-12 document card\" class=\"card-img-top\" height=\"100%\" src=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-images/Standards%20%26%20Instruction%20-%20Math%20Standards%20-%20K12%20Documents%20Card.png\" width=\"100%\" />\r\n<div class=\"card-body\">\r\n<h3 class=\"card-title\">Standards Documents</h3>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"card-text\">A strong mathematics education depends upon a clear understanding of its interrelated concepts, skills, and practices to ensure students are on the pathway to success in their academic careers. The knowledge and skills students need to be prepared for mathematics in college, career, and life are woven throughout the K-12 mathematics performance expectations.</p>\r\n\r\n<ul class=\"list-group list-group-flush\">\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-action list-group-item\"><a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Standards%20%26%20Instruction%20-%20Math%20Standards%20Overview%20-%202.18.2020.pdf\">Full Overview</a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<h3>Standards by Strand</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul class=\"list-group list-group-flush\">\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-action list-group-item\"><a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Standards%20%26%20Instruction%20-%20Math%20Standards%20Quantative%20Reasoning%20-%202.18.2020.pdf\">Quantitative Reasoning</a></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-action list-group-item\"><a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Standards%20%26%20Instruction%20-%20Math%20Standards%20Algebraic%20Reasoning%20-%202.18.2020.pdf\">Algebraic Reasoning</a></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-action list-group-item\"><a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Standards%20%26%20Instruction%20-%20Math%20Standards%20Geometric%20Reasoning%20-%202.18.2020.pdf\">Geometric Reasoning</a></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-action list-group-item\"><a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Standards%20%26%20Instruction%20-%20Math%20Standards%20Statistical%20Reasoning%20-%202.18.2020.pdf\">Statistical Reasoning</a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<h3>Standards by Grade Span</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul class=\"list-group list-group-flush\">\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-action list-group-item\"><a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Standards%20%26%20Instruction%20-%20Childhood%20Math%20Standards%20-%202.18.2020.pdf\">Childhood (K-5)</a></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-action list-group-item\"><a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Standards%20%26%20Instruction%20-%20Early%20Adolescence%20Standards%20-%202.18.2020.pdf\">Early Adolescence (6-8)</a></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-action list-group-item\"><a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Standards%20%26%20Instruction%20-%20Adolescence%20Math%20Standards%20-%202.18.2020.pdf\">Adolescence (9-Diploma)</a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"col-sm-6\">\r\n<div class=\"card\"><img alt=\"additional resrouces card\" class=\"card-img-top\" src=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-images/Standards%20%26%20Instruction%20-%20Math%20Standards%20-%20Additional%20Resources%20Card.png\" width=\"100%\" />\r\n<div class=\"card-body\">\r\n<h3 class=\"card-title\">Resources &amp; Support</h3>\r\n\r\n<h3>Support Documents</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul class=\"list-group list-group-flush\">\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-action list-group-item\"><a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Standards%20%26%20Instruction%20-%20Math%20Standards%20Common%20Addition%20%26%20Subtraction%20Situations%20-%202.18.2020.pdf\">Common Addition &amp; Subtraction Situations</a></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-action list-group-item\"><a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Standards%20%26%20Instruction%20-%20Math%20Standards%20Common%20Multiplication%20%26%20Division%20Situations%20-%202.18.2020.pdf\">Common Multiplication &amp; Division Situations</a></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-action list-group-item\"><a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Standards%20%26%20Instruction%20-%20Math%20Standards%20Properties%20of%20Operations%20Equality%20%26%20Inequality%20-%202.18.2020.pdf\">The Properties of Operations, Equality, &amp; Inequality</a></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-action list-group-item\"><a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Standards%20%26%20Instruction%20-%20Math%20Standards%20Common%20Core%20Glossary%20-%202.18.2020.pdf\">Glossary</a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<h3>Support Videos</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul class=\"list-group list-group-flush\">\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-action list-group-item\"><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=9FbWyXEjcNA\" target=\"_blank\">Introduction to the Revised Standards Documents</a><span class=\"doe-chip\" data-src=\"file\">Video</span></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-action list-group-item\"><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=hGo4TKa-004\" target=\"_blank\">Overview of the 8 Effective Teaching Practices</a><span class=\"doe-chip\" data-src=\"file\">Video</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3>Additional Resources</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul class=\"list-group list-group-flush\">\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-item list-group-item\"><a href=\"https://achievethecore.org/\" target=\"_blank\">Achieve the Core</a><br />\r\n\t- <a href=\"http://achievethecore.org/coherence-map/\" target=\"_blank\">Coherence Map</a><br />\r\n\t- <a href=\"https://achievethecore.org/category/774/mathematics-focus-by-grade-level\" target=\"_blank\">Focus by Grade Level</a><br />\r\n\t- <a href=\"https://achievethecore.org/page/254/progressions-documents-for-the-common-core-state-standards-for-mathematics\" target=\"_blank\">Progression Documents</a></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-item list-group-item\"><a href=\"https://www.illustrativemathematics.org/\" target=\"_blank\">Illustrative Mathematics</a><br />\r\n\t- <a href=\"https://tasks.illustrativemathematics.org/content-standards\" target=\"_blank\">Content Standards</a><br />\r\n\t- <a href=\"http://tasks.illustrativemathematics.org/practice-standards/\" target=\"_blank\">Practice Standards</a></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-item list-group-item\"><a href=\"https://www.nctm.org/\" target=\"_blank\">National Council of Teachers of Mathematics (NCTM)</a><br />\r\n\t- <a href=\"https://www.nctm.org/mathematics2021/\" target=\"_blank\">Continuing the Journey: Mathematics Learning 2021 and Beyond</a></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-action list-group-item\"><a href=\"https://www.mathedleadership.org/\" target=\"_blank\">National Council of Supervisors of Mathematics (NCSM)</a></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-action list-group-item\"><a href=\"https://assm.wildapricot.org/\" target=\"_blank\">Association of State Supervisors of Mathematics (ASSM)</a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n\n<p class=\"doe-top\"><a href=\"#top\">Back to top</a></p>","notes":[],"decisions":[{"id":"outline","on":true,"label":"Rebuild the heading outline","why":"1 heading sits at a level the page never opens — \"\" is an h3 with no h2 above it, so it is neither announced nor styled as the sub-section it is. Each heading moves to one level below whatever encloses it.","value":"h3 → h2"},{"id":"blockhead","on":true,"label":"Turn the headings into section headers","why":"1 heading is plain text where every other page uses a section header, so the page reads as one continuous wall instead of parts.","value":"1 section"},{"id":"filechip","on":true,"label":"Tag a document link with the format it opens","why":"2 links on this page open a file — 2 Video — and say nothing about it, while others in the same list carry a tag because their author typed one. The format is read from the file name, so the list stops being half-labelled. No link text changes.","value":"2 links"},{"id":"cardtitles","on":true,"label":"Put the card titles on one level","why":"2 card titles are written at a level copied from an example rather than chosen — h5 on a page whose sections are h2. Only the number changes.","value":"2 titles"},{"id":"items","on":true,"label":"Separate a link from its description","why":"3 list items open with a link and then explain it, all at the same weight — so the thing you can click is no easier to find than the sentence about it. The link becomes the item and the explanation sits under it.","value":"3 items"},{"id":"deck","on":true,"label":"Use this paragraph as the page description","why":"It is the page’s own opening paragraph, moved into the banner rather than rewritten.","value":"The Maine Learning Results, which incorporates the Common Core State Standards, is a single set of clear educational standards for mathematics. These standards are designed to ensure that students graduating from high school are prepared to go to college or enter the workforce, and parents, teachers and students have a clear understanding of what is expected of them."},{"id":"banner-graphic","on":true,"label":"Retire the old banner graphic","why":"It repeats the page title in picture form, which the new banner already does in type.","removes":"Standards & Instruction - Math Standards - Web Banner.png"},{"id":"cardseg","on":true,"label":"Let a bold line dividing a card be its heading","why":"5 lines inside the cards are a paragraph holding nothing but a few bold words — \"Standards by Strand\" is one — with the part of the card it names underneath. That is a heading, and set as a paragraph it carries no level, so the card offers nothing to scan by and a screen reader announces only running text. Each becomes an h3 and takes the same section bar the other card headings use. Only where a card has two or more, which is what makes them divisions rather than one stressed line. Not a word changes.","value":"5 headings"}],"mechanical":["empty paragraphs removed: 4","b/i to strong/em: 2","drupal entity attrs stripped: 50","target set by destination: 13","line breaks at the edge of a block removed: 1","action links marked: 16"],"findings":[],"safe":true,"audit":{"alias":"/learning/standards/mathematics","title":"Mathematics Standards","changed":"2026-08-04T13:35:35+00:00","words":229,"bytes":9546,"fixes":["empty paragraphs removed: 4","b/i to strong/em: 2","drupal entity attrs stripped: 50","line breaks at the edge of a block removed: 1","action links marked: 16"],"flags":["no section-header device","h5 card titles"],"contentSafe":true,"headings":[{"l":3,"t":"","bh":false},{"l":5,"t":"Standards Documents","bh":false},{"l":5,"t":"Resources &amp; Support","bh":false}],"outline":[{"i":0,"issue":"jumps h1 to h3","text":""},{"i":1,"issue":"jumps h3 to h5","text":"Standards Documents"}],"components":{"cards":9,"cardHeaders":0,"cardTitles":2,"accordions":0,"tables":0,"dataTables":0,"contactCube":0,"jumbotron":0,"dcNote":0,"blockheads":0,"videos":0,"images":3,"buttons":0},"access":{"imagesNoAlt":0,"vagueLinkText":[],"emptyLinks":0,"tablesNoScope":0,"multipleH1":0,"inlineColour":0},"links":{"internal":[],"files":["/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Standards%20%26%20Instruction%20-%20Math%20Standards%20Overview%20-%202.18.2020.pdf","/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Standards%20%26%20Instruction%20-%20Math%20Standards%20Quantative%20Reasoning%20-%202.18.2020.pdf","/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Standards%20%26%20Instruction%20-%20Math%20Standards%20Algebraic%20Reasoning%20-%202.18.2020.pdf","/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Standards%20%26%20Instruction%20-%20Math%20Standards%20Geometric%20Reasoning%20-%20